Package: careless
Type: Package
Title: Procedures for Computing Indices of Careless Responding
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Richard", "Yentes", email = "ryentes@gmail.com", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Francisco", "Wilhelm", email = "franciscowilhelm@gmail.com", role = c("aut")))
Description: The two indices of the CRAN package 'careless' 1.2.2 that
    metacheck's data_check module uses (longstring() and irv()), vendored
    unchanged for the parity tests: the R reference environment cannot
    install 'careless' (it is not on conda-forge), so the test helpers load
    this copy with pkgload::load_all() to exercise the careless-responding
    path. See tests/mod_data_check/dc_helpers.R.
